# ---- 调试/分析产物（AI排查笔记、录屏快照、设计截图，本地归档不入库）----
# 2026-08-09:梳理243个未提交文件时发现这些散落在根目录，属于历史调试
# 产物，已归档到~/WorkBuddy/moneybag-archive/，此处防止未来再堆积
# 仅匹配根目录文件（不加/会误伤docs/等子目录下的正式文档），docs/**/*.yaml例外放行
/*.yaml
!docs/**/*.yaml
.playwright-cli/
/*.png
/INVESTIGATION_*.md
/INVESTIGATION_*.txt
/NIGHT_WORKER_*.md
/NIGHT_WORKER_*.txt
/README_WECHAT_*.md
/WECHAT_*.md
/*_QUICK_REF*.md
/*_QUICK_REF*.txt
/*_ANALYSIS.md
/*_SUMMARY.md
/*_SUMMARY.txt
/TECHNICAL_DEEP_DIVE.md
/START-HERE.md
/READY_TO_IMPLEMENT.md
/IMPLEMENTATION_NEXT_STEPS.md
/SCREENING_*.md
/INDEX.md

